#: traduia-make-repo:22
msgid ""
"Generates a static manifest.json (with size+sha256) for a TraduIA model "
"repo."
msgstr ""
"Genera un manifest.json estàtic (amb size+sha256) per a un repositori de "
"models TraduIA."

#: traduia-make-repo:23
msgid ""
"The output directory is shared: whisper-small/ + one or both model sets + "
"manifest.json"
msgstr ""
"El directori d'eixida és compartit: whisper-small/ + un o tots dos conjunts "
"de models + manifest.json"

#: traduia-make-repo:24
msgid "It can be served statically over HTTP or copied to a USB drive."
msgstr "Pot servir-se estàticament per HTTP o copiar-se a un disc USB."

#: traduia-make-repo:26
msgid "The tool is additive: run it once per set you want in the same output"
msgstr ""
"La ferramenta és additiva: executeu-la una vegada per cada conjunt que "
"vulgueu en el mateix directori d'eixida"

#: traduia-make-repo:27
msgid ""
"directory. whisper-small is only copied on the first run (never duplicated)."
msgstr ""

#: traduia-make-repo:29
msgid ""
"Hardlinks are used when source and destination are on the same filesystem;"
